<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="487003522"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1799643503"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="陽だまりロードナイト"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Roselia"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Re:birth day"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:47.088"><div begin="00:30.883" end="04:26.134"><p begin="00:30.883" end="00:37.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">運命を繋ぐ 赤き道しるべ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">红色的路标与命运相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u n me i wo tsu na gu a ka ki mi chi shi ru be</span></p><p begin="00:37.707" end="00:44.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">唯々前を見つめて 目指すわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一心直视着前方目标确定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ta da ma e wo mi tsu me te me za su wa</span></p><p begin="00:44.444" end="00:49.139" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">声となって 表情となって 導いてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音响彻耳畔表情浮现眼前 给予我指引</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e to na 't te hyo u jo u to na 't te mi chi bi i te ku</span></p><p begin="00:49.376" end="00:51.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">やさしい人よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔之人啊 如同暖阳下的蔷薇辉石</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i hi to yo hi da ma ri ro o do na i to</span></p><p begin="00:52.461" end="00:55.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">陽だまりロードナイト</p><p begin="00:56.682" end="01:04.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">心が悴んでも「大丈夫」と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算感到心力交瘁你也会给予我安慰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ga ka ji ka n de mo 「 da i jo u bu 」 to</span></p><p begin="01:05.802" end="01:11.172" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">言葉で いつも抱きしめた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对我说着“没关系”然后将我拥紧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba de i tsu mo da ki shi me ta</span></p><p begin="01:11.422" end="01:14.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">(笑顔ひとしずく)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅需一个笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 e ga o hi to shi zu ku 】</span></p><p begin="01:14.799" end="01:17.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">幸せが沁みわたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能让幸福充斥于心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se ga shi mi wa ta 't te</span></p><p begin="01:17.998" end="01:21.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">(頬濡らした夜も)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在以泪洗面的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 ho ho nu ra shi ta yo ru mo 】</span></p><p begin="01:21.399" end="01:24.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">すべて受け止め 信じ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会接受一切 坚信不疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te u ke to me shi n ji</span></p><p begin="01:24.795" end="01:27.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">(変わるよ 世界が)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界会有所改变的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 ka wa ru yo se ka i ga 】</span></p><p begin="01:28.249" end="01:32.474" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">こんなにも愛しさで満ちてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份爱意令人感觉是如此充盈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni mo i to shi sa de mi chi te ru</span></p><p begin="01:34.330" end="01:38.651" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">明日も まぶしいくらいに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令明天也变得如此璀璨夺目</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a su mo ma bu shi i ku ra i ni</span></p><p begin="01:54.579" end="02:01.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">離れていても 帰る場所がある<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算天各一方也有自己的归所</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na re te i te mo ka e ru ba sho ga a ru</span></p><p begin="02:01.616" end="02:08.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">どんな時でも 傍にいてくれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论何时都陪伴在我的身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na to ki de mo so ba ni i te ku re ta</span></p><p begin="02:08.292" end="02:11.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">太陽となって 月となって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时而化作太阳时而化作月亮 照亮我身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i yo u to na 't te tsu ki to na 't te te ra shi te ku</span></p><p begin="02:11.667" end="02:13.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">照らしてく</p><p begin="02:13.398" end="02:19.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">つよい人よ 陽だまりロードナイト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚强之人啊 如同暖阳下的蔷薇辉石</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo i hi to yo hi da ma ri ro o do na i to</span></p><p begin="02:20.667" end="02:28.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">励ます魔法のように 囁いたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呢喃的话语如同鼓励的魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ge ma su ma ho u no yo u ni sa sa ya i ta no</span></p><p begin="02:29.738" end="02:35.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">「あなたがいれば、怖くないよ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“只要有你在我便无所畏惧”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 a na ta ga i re ba 、 ko wa ku na i yo 」</span></p><p begin="03:04.276" end="03:05.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">日々は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天的时光都被毫无缝隙地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi bi ha 【 i ro zu ki ki ra me ku 】</span></p><p begin="03:05.607" end="03:08.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">(色づき煌めく)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">【光芒照耀万物】</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi bi ha 【 i ro zu ki ki ra me ku 】</span></p><p begin="03:08.744" end="03:11.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">隙間なく鮮やかに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">涂抹得璀璨夺目 色彩斑斓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ma na ku a za ya ka ni</span></p><p begin="03:12.040" end="03:15.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">(初めての気持ちを)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更多地让我知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 ha ji me te no ki mo chi wo 】</span></p><p begin="03:15.493" end="03:18.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">教えてくれた もっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份初次体会的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o shi e te ku re ta mo 't to</span></p><p begin="03:18.838" end="03:21.814" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">(名前を呼ぶ声)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼唤名字这件事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 na ma e wo yo bu ko e 】</span></p><p begin="03:22.228" end="03:26.574" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">こんなにも特別な事だと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟然会让人感到如此特别</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni mo to ku be tsu na ko to da to</span></p><p begin="03:28.336" end="03:31.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">想い あふれてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思念就此充盈于我的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i a fu re te yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:32.361" end="03:35.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">(笑顔ひとしずく)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅需一个笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 e ga o hi to shi zu ku 】</span></p><p begin="03:35.655" end="03:38.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">幸せが沁みわたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能让幸福充斥于心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se ga shi mi wa ta 't te</span></p><p begin="03:38.924" end="03:42.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">(頬濡らした夜も)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在以泪洗面的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 ho ho nu ra shi ta yo ru mo 】</span></p><p begin="03:42.349" end="03:45.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">すべて受け止め 信じ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会接受一切 坚信不疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te u ke to me shi n ji</span></p><p begin="03:45.766" end="03:48.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">(変わるよ 世界が)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界会有所改变的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">【 ka wa ru yo se ka i ga 】</span></p><p begin="03:49.212" end="03:53.461" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">こんなにも愛しさで満ちてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份爱意令人感觉是如此充盈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni mo i to shi sa de mi chi te ru</span></p><p begin="03:55.319" end="03:59.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">明日も まぶしいくらいに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令明天也变得如此璀璨夺目</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a su mo ma bu shi i ku ra i ni</span></p><p begin="04:04.978" end="04:07.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">感謝を…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我表达这份感谢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n sha wo Oh oh</span></p><p begin="04:13.128" end="04:26.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Oh, oh…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh,oh…</span></p></div></body></tt>